				<r3d:description language="eng">HI HOPES aims is to provide free home based support and information without bias to every family with an infant or toddler with hearing loss. Through an early intervention framework of care, support, information and partnership in a culturally sensitive, community based manner to allow we aim to empower the family in their home environment and help the baby with a hearing loss to reach her/his full potential.</r3d:description>
